# Krezk's watch answers a crime somebody saw inside the wall (F8 and F2's town watch; docs/rules/stealth.md,
# docs/voice/krezk_guard.md). story/crime.gd counts the offence in crime_krezk and stages a Krezk Watchman beside the
# party, then plays theft or trespass. Every way out clears the count: a fine, a word that works, or a fight.

~ theft
Krezk Watchman [angry]: That's far enough. Put it back. We let you in, and this is how you thank us? Krezk is a village. Everybody saw.
-> charge

~ trespass
Krezk Watchman [angry]: You were told that house isn't yours. In Krezk we knock, and we leave when we're asked.
-> charge

~ charge
if flag.crime_krezk >= 2
Krezk Watchman: Twice now. Twenty-five gold for the people you took from, or out of the gate, and you can explain yourselves to the wolves.
else
Krezk Watchman: Ten gold, for the trouble. The burgomaster would want more. I'm not the burgomaster.
endif
* [if flag.crime_krezk < 2 and gold >= 10] Pay the ten gold. -> pay_small
* [if flag.crime_krezk >= 2 and gold >= 25] Pay the twenty-five gold. -> pay_large
* [if flag.crime_krezk < 2 and gold < 10] We haven't got ten gold. -> empty_purse
* [if flag.crime_krezk >= 2 and gold < 25] We haven't got twenty-five gold. -> empty_purse
* [Persuasion DC 15] We meant no harm. It won't happen again. -> let_off | not_buying
* [Intimidation DC 17] You're one man with a spear. Walk away. -> let_off | not_buying
* Refuse. -> refuse

~ not_buying
Krezk Watchman: No. I know everyone in Krezk by their cough, and none of them would believe that either.
* [if flag.crime_krezk < 2 and gold >= 10] Pay the ten gold. -> pay_small
* [if flag.crime_krezk >= 2 and gold >= 25] Pay the twenty-five gold. -> pay_large
* [if flag.crime_krezk < 2 and gold < 10] We haven't got ten gold. -> empty_purse
* [if flag.crime_krezk >= 2 and gold < 25] We haven't got twenty-five gold. -> empty_purse
* Refuse. -> refuse

~ pay_small
gold -10
set crime_krezk = 0
Krezk Watchman: Good. That's done, then. Don't make me do it again; I've got sheep.
-> END

~ pay_large
gold -25
set crime_krezk = 0
Krezk Watchman: Paid. Next time it's the gate, and the gate doesn't take coin.
-> END

~ empty_purse
gold -25
set crime_krezk = 0
Krezk Watchman: Then whatever's in your purse. Out with it. All of it. Shelter's for Krezk, and so is that, now.
-> END

~ let_off
set crime_krezk = 0
Krezk Watchman: Fine. Go. And if the Abbot asks, I never saw you. I'd rather he didn't ask.
-> END

~ refuse
Krezk Watchman [angry]: Then I'll do it the hard way. Up on the wall! To me!
combat watch_arrest
